        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.146,
            0.896,
            0.216
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Now n = 51. So, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac{n}{2}=\\frac{51}{2}=25.5"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " . This observation lies in the class 145 - 150. Then, l (the lower limit) = 145,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.249,
            0.226,
            0.895,
            0.246
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "cf (the cumulative frequency of the class preceding "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 4 5 \\textrm { - } 1 5 0 )   =   1 1"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.257,
            0.253,
            0.771,
            0.273
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "f (the frequency of the median class 145 - 150) = 18,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.256,
            0.278,
            0.471,
            0.297
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "h (the class size) = 5."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.126,
            0.306,
            0.69,
            0.389
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Using the formula, Median "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathbf { l } = l + \\left( { \\frac { { \\displaystyle { \\frac { n } { 2 } } } - \\mathbf { c f } } { f } } \\right) \\times h ."
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , we have"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.31,
            0.403,
            0.618,
            0.503
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_24_equation_7.jpg",
          "content": "\\begin{aligned} & Mean  = 145 + \\left( \\frac{25.5 - 11}{18} \\right) \\times 5 \\\\&= 145 + \\frac{72.5}{18} = 149.03.5\\\\ \\end{aligned}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.506,
            0.546,
            0.525
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "So, the median height of the girls is 149.03 cm."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.097,
            0.531,
            0.901,
            0.57
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "This means that the height of about 50% of the girls is less than this height, and 50% are taller than this height."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.096,
            0.574,
            0.9,
            0.614
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example 8 :",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " The median of the following data is 525. Find the values of x and y, if the total frequency is 100."
